        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "1 55",
        "output": "Yes",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\n(1,55)(1, 55)(1,55) is a Oneful Pair\\text{Oneful Pair}Oneful Pair, since 1+55+(1⋅55)=56+55=1111 + 55 + (1 \\cdot 55) = 56 + 55 = 1111+55+(1⋅55)=56+55=111."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_2",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "1 56",
        "output": "No",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\n(1,56)(1, 56)(1,56) is not a Oneful Pair\\text{Oneful Pair}Oneful Pair, since 1+56+(1⋅56)=57+56=113≠1111 + 56 + (1 \\cdot 56) = 57 + 56 = 113 \\neq 1111+56+(1⋅56)=57+56=113=111"
      }
    ]
